# Unreleased app — no old-bundle compatibility

The FoodCheck mobile app is in development and has **not been released**.

- Do not preserve old app bundles, deprecated DTO fields, or dual API shapes “for existing clients.”
- Prefer the current correct model. Example: `ingredient_codes` (INS, E, CAS, future schemes) on one ingredient; drop `e_number`-only shims when they get in the way.
- Breaking API/UI changes are acceptable until a production release.
